  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>q</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;...(i)<br /><br /><math><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#951;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;...(ii)<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;...(iii)<br /><br />Substituting the value of r in Eq. (ii), we get<br /><br /><math><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#951;</mi><mi>v</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#951;</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Again substituting <math><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math>we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#951;</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></math><br /><br />Or <math><mi>q</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#951;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>E</mi></mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#951;</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Substituting the values, we get<br /><br /><math><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>81</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>900</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9.8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>216</mn><msup><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>&#160;</mi></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>8.0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>"
